WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.760
Festival practice continues, but first-time blessings

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:06.060
are not repeated automatically.

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.400
Track the actual completed action and the

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.360
day's conditions rather than confusing a streak

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:13.580
with correct practice.
